# THE LINE BRINGS THE ROOF DOWN (CrackedRoof, FightSim.hangings, AbilityGrapple):
# round a cave's tears the lid hangs cracked, a fat stone split near its root and
# stained down its length. Stood a throw off one and facing it, the grapple's
# line takes it and it shakes; then it comes down, breaks on the floor and lies.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/cracked_roof.tour --seed=7 --realm=underground --hour=12 --fit=boots_magnet --config=unharmed
coast calm
wait 1.0
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
near cracked_stone
wait 1.0
shot 01-a-stone-hangs-cracked with shoulder
tap lamp
wait 0.5
shot 02-by-the-lamp with shoulder,lamp
tap ability_grapple
wait 0.2
shot 03-the-line-takes-it with shoulder,lamp
await stone_fell 3
wait 0.6
shot 04-down-and-broken with shoulder,lamp
